// Castarr — build secrets template
//
// SETUP:
//   1. Copy this file to `Secrets.xcconfig` (same directory).
//   2. Paste your TMDB API Read Access Token below.
//   3. `Secrets.xcconfig` is gitignored — it must never be committed.
//
// Get a token: https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
// Use the "API Read Access Token" (the long eyJ... JWT), NOT the v3 API key.
// It is read-only, which is all Castarr needs.
//
// In Xcode: Project → Info → Configurations → set Debug and Release for the
// Castarr target to use `Secrets`. The value is surfaced to the app through
// the TMDB_READ_TOKEN key in Info.plist.

TMDB_READ_TOKEN = your_tmdb_read_access_token_here
